'''Bloodfist Point''' is a [[Horde]]-aligned outpost located in northern [[Azshara]]. It's the forefront of the Horde's efforts to tame the haunted lands of Azshara.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20260514170802/https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps New Zones & World Edits]. Archived from [https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps the original] on 2026-05-14. Retrieved on 2026-29-08.</ref>

